The morning session (7-9 AM): the couple sits at the desk and gathers items. object_16 (a kitchen item) and object_33 are at receptacle_12. object_20 is also at receptacle_12 at 8 AM. object_5 is at receptacle_21 (the bedroom) at 8 AM, suggesting one resident is getting ready in the bedroom while the other is at the desk. By 9 AM, the session ends: object_21 is at receptacle_19 (the side shelf), object_16 moves to receptacle_4 (the kitchen counter), and the kitchen routine begins.

